('127.682.d.5.B',4,'Why is humidity control important for network equipment?','["it improves music", "too much causes corrosion and too little causes static", "it makes cables longer", "it paints walls"]'::jsonb,1,'Both extremes can harm electronics.','original'),
('127.682.d.5.C',3,'The port on a switch where a computer''s cable plugs in is typically labeled:','["VGA", "HDMI", "Ethernet or RJ-45", "audio"]'::jsonb,2,'Ethernet ports accept RJ-45 plugs.','original'),
('127.682.d.5.C',4,'A device that joins two different networks and forwards traffic between them is a:','["speaker", "keyboard", "scanner", "router"]'::jsonb,3,'Routers connect networks.','original')
